1
00:00:00,952 --> 00:00:02,952
[MUMBLING]

2
00:00:12,172 --> 00:00:13,502
(Leonard:)Oh, God.

3
00:00:15,049 --> 00:00:17,339
(Leonard:)Why don't you just eat
in your desk chair?

4
00:00:17,510 --> 00:00:19,800
(Sheldon:)Why don't I just eat in my desk chair?

5
00:00:19,971 --> 00:00:21,851
(Leonard:)Here we go.

6
00:00:22,056 --> 00:00:24,846
(Sheldon:)That is my desk chair.
That is where I work.

7
00:00:25,018 --> 00:00:28,648
(Sheldon:)I don't eat in my desk chair
and I don't work in my spot.

8
00:00:28,813 --> 00:00:32,353
(Sheldon:)I work in my desk chair
and eat in my spot.

9
00:00:32,525 --> 00:00:34,235
Whackadoodle.

10
00:00:34,861 --> 00:00:38,701
(Howard:)You know, there's kind of
an obvious solution here. Get up.

11
00:00:43,369 --> 00:00:44,699
(Howard:)There, problem solved.

12
00:00:46,206 --> 00:00:47,876
Nobody cares where you're gonna sit.

13
00:00:48,041 --> 00:00:49,421
(Howard:)You're not crazy.

14
00:00:52,545 --> 00:00:54,925
(Scene:)Excuse me,
but the problem is not solved.

15
00:00:55,089 --> 00:00:57,799
(Sheldon:)If your head
had been accidentally amputated...

